      "pages": {
        "end": 21,
        "start": 21
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "It -- it might. All of these -- I mean, we don't take the position that a consumer survey is necessary in order to prove a case in the first place, but I think the way a survey would be designed and what the answers would show is illustrative of what constitutes dilution."
    },
